(RURAL WATER SUPPLY DEPARTMENT — Tender CE/CIV/58/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers rural piped water supply scheme — pumping and treated water) Tj T*
(supply complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART C — HORIZONTAL CENTRIFUGAL PUMPS) Tj T*
(\(a\) Horizontal centrifugal pumps for clear cold water shall comply with IS 1520:1980.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Duty point of each pump shall be 250 m³/h discharge at 45 metres total dynamic head.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Guaranteed pump efficiency at the rated duty shall be minimum 78 percent.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Pump casing shall be CI and impeller of leaded tin bronze.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Sound pressure level shall be limited to 85 dB\(A\) at 1 metres distance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PUMP DATA SHEET) Tj T*
(Rated discharge: 250 m³/h) Tj T*
(Total dynamic head: 45 metres) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — DRIVE MOTORS) Tj T*
(\(a\) The drive motor shall be a three phase TEFC squirrel cage induction motor as per IS) Tj T*
(325:1996.) Tj T*
(\(b\) MOTOR RATING SHALL BE 37 KW CONTINUOUS. Motors shall operate satisfactorily on a) Tj T*
(supply of 415 Volt ± 10 percent and 50 c/s ± 5 percent.) Tj T*
(\(c\) The motor shall be premium efficiency IE3 conforming to IS 12615:2018.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Motor enclosure shall be totally enclosed fan cooled with IP 55 protection.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Insulation shall be class F and the motor shall be rated for S1 continuous duty.) Tj T*
(\(f\) Motor speed shall be 1500 RPM \(4 pole\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — TREATED WATER QUALITY) Tj T*
(\(a\) The quality of water supplied shall meet IS 10500:2012. pH value: 6.5 to 8.5) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
ET
