(RURAL WATER SUPPLY DEPARTMENT — Tender CE/CIV/58/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(b\) TDS of supplied water shall be within 500 mg/litre.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Turbidity of treated water shall be limited to 1 NTU. Fluoride content shall be) Tj T*
(within 1.0 mg/litre.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Nitrate as NO3 shall be less than 45 mg/litre.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Arsenic content in supplied water shall be less than 0.05 mg/litre.) Tj T*
(\(f\) Total hardness shall be within 200 mg/litre as CaCO3.) Tj T*
(\(g\) Total coliforms shall be absent in any 100 ml sample.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6 TESTS AND INSPECTION) Tj T*
(\(a\) Performance tests on each pump shall be conducted as per IS 9137 in the presence of) Tj T*
(the Engineer. Each motor shall be subjected to routine tests in accordance with IS 4029.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Motors shall be BIS certified and test certificates shall be furnished.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Physico-chemical tests shall follow IS 3025 and bacteriological examination shall) Tj T*
(follow IS 1622. Pre-dispatch inspection shall be offered to the Department's authorised) Tj T*
(representative with 15 days notice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7 DOCUMENTATION, WARRANTY AND TRAINING) Tj T*
(\(a\) MONTHLY WATER QUALITY REPORTS SHALL BE FURNISHED TO THE DEPARTMENT.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Shop drawings and schematic diagrams shall be got approved from the Engineer-in-) Tj T*
(charge before manufacture.) Tj T*
(\(c\) O&M manuals, as-built drawings and catalogues shall be furnished in triplicate at) Tj T*
(the time of handing over.) Tj T*
(\(d\) The supplier shall replace free of cost any part found defective within the defect) Tj T*
(liability period of 24 months.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Training of two operators for one week shall be imparted by the supplier after) Tj T*
(commissioning.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BILL OF QUANTITIES) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 3 of 4) Tj T*
